# src/apps/android/app/src/main/java/com/luminet/android

## Purpose
Android Activity/VpnService product implementation and generated-binding integration.

## Contents
- Direct files (6): `LumiNetActivity.kt`, `LumiNetTileService.kt`, `PerAppVpnPolicy.kt`, `UnderlyingNetworkTracker.kt`, `VpnEngineService.kt`, `VpnRuntimeState.kt`

## Interfaces and dependencies
- Android/Gradle source or build metadata; runtime calls enter the generated Go mobile binding rather than a second native runtime.

## Invariants
- Android lifecycle authority remains VpnEngineService → generated Go mobile binding → canonical daemon/system owners.

